(7758951, 1284582, 27608, '<td valign="top">On my first pass of this, I scored it low.  I didn''t like that I needed to turn my laptop to see the landscape within the outline.  But after going back on my cell I got a better appreciation for the cross being placed in the eye.  Now it reminds me of the Borg.  Not my favourite, but definitely top 5</td>', 'On my first pass of this, I scored it low.  I didn''t like that I needed to turn my laptop to see the landscape within the outline.  But after going back on my cell I got a better appreciation for the cross being placed in the eye.  Now it reminds me of the Borg.  Not my favourite, but definitely top 5', '2023-10-16 14:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
